# create-elf-mage: pass the code wheel, create a female Elf Magic-user, neutral good, named Mira (the class list of an
# Elf starts at Fighter, so one END reaches Magic-user), keep the rolled scores, then add her to the party from
# the saved characters list (A) and look at the party screen. Menu keys as in create-character.keys.
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key C
wait 10
key END                  # race: Elf
key ENTER
wait 10
key END                  # sex: Female
key ENTER
wait 10
key END                  # class: Magic-user
key ENTER
wait 10
key END                  # alignment: Neutral good
key ENTER
wait 40
shot sheet               # the rolled sheet: a Magic-user with spells
key Y
wait 15
text Mira
key ENTER
wait 15
key K                    # Head Body Keep > Keep
wait 20
key E                    # icon editor: Exit
wait 20
key Y
wait 40
shot main-menu
key A                    # Add character to party
wait 40
shot add-list
key ENTER                # the first saved character
wait 60
shot party
